1
00:00:01,620 --> 00:00:02,820
You win!

2
00:00:04,820 --> 00:00:05,920
Here we are,

3
00:00:06,160 --> 00:00:09,257
traveling through the forest to
defeat the Stratum Lord and hopefully

4
00:00:09,340 --> 00:00:13,105
turn the trees that used to be
villagers back into people again.

5
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:17,840
My goodness, this is all quite a bother.

6
00:00:18,260 --> 00:00:20,789
I shall absorb the
felled tree with fields.

7
00:00:25,820 --> 00:00:28,257
The monsters aren't attacking
the village anymore,

8
00:00:28,340 --> 00:00:31,420
But felling trees is
sending them into a frenzy.

9
00:00:32,760 --> 00:00:33,590
Barrier!

10
00:00:34,200 --> 00:00:38,180
And launch reinforced plastic
bottles filled with pachinko balls!

11
00:00:39,720 --> 00:00:40,600
Oh gross!

12
00:00:40,760 --> 00:00:42,337
Why's it gotta be so stinky?

13
00:00:42,420 --> 00:00:44,361
They smell bad, they taste great!

14
00:00:44,760 --> 00:00:47,936
Don't eat too much now or
you'll be too full to fight.

15
00:01:03,060 --> 00:01:07,297
The Elder Tree Fiend
Stratum Lord it's still not

16
00:01:07,380 --> 00:01:10,917
coming after us it was
originally quite gentle.

17
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:14,437
Sort of guardian deity
for this stratum when

18
00:01:14,520 --> 00:01:16,497
it attacked the village
we were all shocked.

19
00:01:16,580 --> 00:01:21,097
I for one blame the Nether
Lord that may be but

20
00:01:21,180 --> 00:01:23,457
if you want to turn the
tree people back to normal?

21
00:01:23,540 --> 00:01:25,317
well, then we'll have to beat it.

22
00:01:25,400 --> 00:01:26,230
Indeed,

23
00:01:26,313 --> 00:01:28,477
and I'm positive that
pouring this anti-plant

24
00:01:28,560 --> 00:01:31,148
poison right onto it
should accomplish that.

25
00:01:31,240 --> 00:01:33,020
The plan is to use Lamas,

26
00:01:33,240 --> 00:01:36,117
Kuroyata, and the old man's magic
to pour what's in those barrels?

27
00:01:36,200 --> 00:01:37,517
into its eyes and mouth.

28
00:01:37,600 --> 00:01:41,357
To do that, we'll have to get to its
base first, which is no easy task.

29
00:01:41,440 --> 00:01:43,558
And who knows how much time we have.

30
00:01:51,400 --> 00:01:55,917
On the outside I'm just a big metal box
but inside I've still got a human soul.

31
00:01:56,000 --> 00:01:58,317
In this new world of
wonders I travel to and

32
00:01:58,400 --> 00:02:00,137
fro on the back of my
super strong partner.

33
00:02:00,220 --> 00:02:05,180
Llamas the name's Boxo hello
there that means yes by the way.

34
00:02:51,300 --> 00:02:52,617
I'll

35
00:02:52,700 --> 00:02:59,237
see you

36
00:02:59,320 --> 00:03:06,320
next

37
00:03:13,000 --> 00:03:13,830
time.

38
00:03:21,660 --> 00:03:25,537
Voxo, all my energy is depleted
because I'm so hungry I can't move.

39
00:03:25,620 --> 00:03:26,917
Yeah, yeah, save me here.

40
00:03:27,000 --> 00:03:28,997
It's absolutely freezing out here.

41
00:03:29,080 --> 00:03:31,497
It sucks that we can't even
start a fire to warm up.

42
00:03:31,580 --> 00:03:33,917
Not to rub it in, but I don't feel cold.

43
00:03:34,000 --> 00:03:36,941
Not with this awesome magic
cloak I got from Voxo.

44
00:03:37,220 --> 00:03:39,377
Yes, the cloak from the weapons shop.

45
00:03:39,460 --> 00:03:41,989
I bought it and gave
it to Lamas as a gift.

46
00:03:42,100 --> 00:03:44,060
Didn't you get me anything, Boxo?

47
00:03:44,240 --> 00:03:46,357
I look forward to serving you again.

48
00:03:46,440 --> 00:03:48,117
Wow, way to dodge the question.

49
00:03:48,200 --> 00:03:51,197
How about you revisit this
love triangle drama later, huh?

50
00:03:51,280 --> 00:03:54,677
I'm so hungry my stomach's turned into
some kind of monster eating itself.

51
00:03:54,760 --> 00:03:55,860
I think I'm next.

52
00:03:56,260 --> 00:03:57,140
Oh, right.

53
00:03:57,360 --> 00:03:59,757
I mustn't forget my duty
as a vending machine.

54
00:03:59,840 --> 00:04:02,134
It's cold, so how about some cup ramen?

55
00:04:02,360 --> 00:04:05,066
No, let's make dinner a
little more elaborate.

56
00:04:05,860 --> 00:04:06,820
Form change!

57
00:04:08,220 --> 00:04:10,477
Boxo changed into a shape
I've never seen before.

58
00:04:10,560 --> 00:04:11,913
Are these new products?

59
00:04:12,280 --> 00:04:13,140
Hello there!

60
00:04:14,960 --> 00:04:16,300
Quick question, folks.

61
00:04:16,620 --> 00:04:19,097
Have you ever heard of
the term auto restaurant?

62
00:04:19,180 --> 00:04:22,337
They were 24-hour vending machine-only
restaurants that were once built

63
00:04:22,420 --> 00:04:26,832
along highways where motorists could
pull over and eat anytime they wanted.

64
00:04:27,540 --> 00:04:32,197
They were a big fad, and they coincided
with the spreading craze of video games.

65
00:04:32,280 --> 00:04:35,517
But about 10 years later, with the
advent of the convenience store,

66
00:04:35,600 --> 00:04:38,129
their numbers started
to gradually decline.

67
00:04:39,640 --> 00:04:40,680
Check it out!

68
00:04:40,900 --> 00:04:44,357
This is one of those retro-bending
machines that once took the world by storm.

69
00:04:44,440 --> 00:04:47,260
Oh, this is different
from the usual pasta.

70
00:04:47,540 --> 00:04:48,658
It's kind of thick.

71
00:04:52,020 --> 00:04:53,820
And it's so warm and savory!

72
00:04:54,140 --> 00:04:57,257
The thick pasta is more filling,
and this broth is to die for!

73
00:04:57,340 --> 00:04:58,693
What an unusual flavor!

74
00:04:59,060 --> 00:05:00,942
Boxo, how do you always deliver?

75
00:05:01,560 --> 00:05:03,540
Kelp broth is rare in this world.

76
00:05:03,760 --> 00:05:05,340
People go wild for it.

77
00:05:05,460 --> 00:05:06,937
I want some! Yeah, me too!

78
00:05:07,020 --> 00:05:07,850
Give me three!

79
00:05:08,020 --> 00:05:08,850
Give me four!

80
00:05:08,960 --> 00:05:10,019
And I want second!

81
00:05:10,360 --> 00:05:12,419
I can't stop there, though, no way!

82
00:05:13,600 --> 00:05:15,306
Nah, we're changing the menu.

83
00:05:15,720 --> 00:05:16,600
Form change!

84
00:05:17,340 --> 00:05:19,897
Huh, he turned into a
different shape already?

85
00:05:19,980 --> 00:05:22,686
Now do we get to try the
food in this picture?

86
00:05:26,080 --> 00:05:27,797
It's brooming with meat juice!

87
00:05:27,880 --> 00:05:29,233
This is a new favorite!

88
00:05:29,760 --> 00:05:30,590
Sweet!

89
00:05:30,673 --> 00:05:32,137
Looks like this went over well, too!

90
00:05:32,220 --> 00:05:34,737
Boxo, I think this is the best
thing you've given us yet!

91
00:05:34,820 --> 00:05:36,137
Hot and fresh and tasty!

92
00:05:36,220 --> 00:05:40,161
I'll say, delicious meat surrounded
by two pieces of bread, genius.

93
00:05:40,540 --> 00:05:44,377
In my former life as a vending
machine enthusiast, this was my hobby.

94
00:05:44,460 --> 00:05:46,817
I loved traveling from
place to place sampling

95
00:05:46,900 --> 00:05:48,697
all the different vending
machine's products.

96
00:05:48,780 --> 00:05:52,017
My friends judged my hobby, calling
it a waste of time and money.

97
00:05:52,100 --> 00:05:56,394
But I sure am happy that it's proving
useful to the people of this world.

98
00:06:12,920 --> 00:06:15,857
Kiko, you and I are taking
turns being in charge of meals.

99
00:06:15,940 --> 00:06:16,957
We can't use fire,

100
00:06:17,040 --> 00:06:20,097
so all she can fix are fruits and
vegetables that can be eaten raw.

101
00:06:20,180 --> 00:06:21,827
Those are a big hit, though.

102
00:06:22,760 --> 00:06:24,600
So good, can't handle it!

103
00:06:24,780 --> 00:06:26,817
And there's plenty more
where that came from!

104
00:06:26,900 --> 00:06:27,730
More, please!

105
00:06:27,980 --> 00:06:29,740
I might be getting annoyed.

106
00:06:30,600 --> 00:06:34,937
Some decades back, someone defeated
one of the Elder Tree Fiends.

107
00:06:35,020 --> 00:06:38,517
I hear they did it by burning
it to a crisp with fire magic.

108
00:06:38,600 --> 00:06:40,957
That started a great fire on this stratum.

109
00:06:41,040 --> 00:06:45,864
And for ten years it was a sad place where
neither monsters nor people could live.

110
00:06:46,320 --> 00:06:49,117
Oh, so that must be why fire
is banned in this forest.

111
00:06:49,200 --> 00:06:53,082
I gotta say, it's kind of inconvenient
not being able to use fire.

112
00:06:53,260 --> 00:06:54,180
That it is.

113
00:06:54,380 --> 00:06:56,757
It's surprisingly chilly
at night in the forest.

114
00:06:56,840 --> 00:06:59,617
All the more so after all the
sweaty work during the day.

115
00:06:59,700 --> 00:07:01,497
And everyone's covered in dirt.

116
00:07:01,580 --> 00:07:03,837
If only they could take a nice hot bath.

117
00:07:03,920 --> 00:07:04,760
Wait a minute!

118
00:07:05,020 --> 00:07:08,667
I almost forgot about my hot
springs vending machine function.

119
00:07:11,020 --> 00:07:11,850
Great!

120
00:07:11,933 --> 00:07:13,800
Here comes the next one! Ready.

121
00:07:14,960 --> 00:07:16,420
First, the foundation.

122
00:07:16,760 --> 00:07:20,017
Above that goes the bathtub, and
over there's the changing area.

123
00:07:20,100 --> 00:07:23,137
This is definitely a high-level
collaborative DIY project.

124
00:07:23,220 --> 00:07:25,691
The handcrafted open-air bath is complete.

125
00:07:25,820 --> 00:07:26,660
So quick!

126
00:07:27,180 --> 00:07:28,660
Hot water time!

127
00:07:29,000 --> 00:07:30,176
Looking good so far.

128
00:07:30,340 --> 00:07:32,575
Pulumi's design was flawless as usual.

129
00:07:33,520 --> 00:07:35,580
Oh, my. This is impressive.

130
00:07:36,080 --> 00:07:39,437
There is, however, no guarantee
that no monsters lurk nearby.

131
00:07:39,520 --> 00:07:41,638
As such, I volunteer for guard duty.

132
00:07:42,080 --> 00:07:42,910
Fear not.

133
00:07:42,993 --> 00:07:46,448
I swear by the gods that I would
never even dream of peeping.

134
00:07:52,380 --> 00:07:53,620
You needn't bother.

135
00:07:54,300 --> 00:07:55,280
But thanks.

136
00:07:55,660 --> 00:07:58,248
Botan and Kurayatsu
will stand guard for us.

137
00:07:59,940 --> 00:08:01,297
First bath in a while.

138
00:08:01,380 --> 00:08:03,380
Oh, man, I can hardly wait.

139
00:08:04,700 --> 00:08:06,297
Wait, what's Boxo doing here?

140
00:08:06,380 --> 00:08:07,210
Hello there.

141
00:08:07,340 --> 00:08:10,697
Well, we are gonna need towels and
that foamy liquid stuff after all.

142
00:08:10,780 --> 00:08:12,437
Yes, but we can get those in advance.

143
00:08:12,520 --> 00:08:13,597
There's no reason to wait.

144
00:08:13,680 --> 00:08:14,537
Have you forgotten?

145
00:08:14,620 --> 00:08:17,797
Inside of Boxo, there lives the soul
of a human man with all its foibles.

146
00:08:17,880 --> 00:08:21,177
Yeah, that may be true, but as long
as it's just Boxo, I don't mind.

147
00:08:21,260 --> 00:08:23,197
Why are you two just
standing there gabbing?

148
00:08:23,280 --> 00:08:25,277
You forget that there are
monsters in this forest?

149
00:08:25,360 --> 00:08:27,497
You gotta get in, get
out, and nobody gets hurt.

150
00:08:27,580 --> 00:08:28,477
Well, I'm with Lamas.

151
00:08:28,560 --> 00:08:32,795
I mean, I suppose I don't really mind
either, as long as it's only Voxo.

152
00:08:33,400 --> 00:08:34,557
Lom, it's...

153
00:08:34,640 --> 00:08:35,480
Yeah, Voxo?

154
00:08:36,100 --> 00:08:37,060
Over there.

155
00:08:38,080 --> 00:08:40,240
Sorry, Voxo. Hello there.

156
00:08:40,740 --> 00:08:43,117
I'll go ahead and buy enough for everyone.

157
00:08:43,200 --> 00:08:46,906
Let's see, we'll need more towels
and some of that foamy stuff.

158
00:08:48,820 --> 00:08:51,291
I guess you and I are both standing guard.

159
00:08:52,460 --> 00:08:53,290
Hmm?

160
00:08:55,920 --> 00:08:58,600
This must be what paradise is like. Wow.

161
00:08:58,860 --> 00:09:01,566
I honestly can't believe
how relaxing this is.

162
00:09:01,780 --> 00:09:03,957
I guarantee I'm going
to sleep well tonight.

163
00:09:04,040 --> 00:09:04,920
Warm and cozy.

164
00:09:08,120 --> 00:09:09,708
Kuroyata, what's the matter?

165
00:09:13,740 --> 00:09:16,446
Doesn't the sky over
there seem unusually red?

166
00:09:16,680 --> 00:09:17,740
It can't be.

167
00:09:19,040 --> 00:09:19,920
Oh, no!

168
00:09:20,220 --> 00:09:21,514
The forest is on fire!

169
00:09:21,680 --> 00:09:23,268
Tell everyone to gather up!

170
00:09:28,540 --> 00:09:29,580
No, no...

171
00:09:49,740 --> 00:09:51,717
Black Black, what's going on here?

172
00:09:51,800 --> 00:09:54,197
I don't know what's up
any better than you,

173
00:09:54,280 --> 00:09:57,377
but my guess is that somebody's
burned the elder tree fiends

174
00:09:57,460 --> 00:10:01,040
Stratum Lord to death We can
look into that later right now.

175
00:10:01,180 --> 00:10:06,062
We're racing against time to get out of
this forest You're right, band of gluttons.

176
00:10:06,440 --> 00:10:08,777
If the Stratum Lord has
truly been defeated,

177
00:10:08,860 --> 00:10:11,517
the inhabitants who turned into
trees should have recovered too.

178
00:10:11,600 --> 00:10:14,317
You four go back to the
village and tell them

179
00:10:14,400 --> 00:10:16,997
to evacuate the Clear
Flow Lake Stratum at once.

180
00:10:17,080 --> 00:10:19,492
The transfer circle should be functional.

181
00:10:21,800 --> 00:10:23,360
So what do we do, then?

182
00:10:23,820 --> 00:10:25,537
Some reconnaissance is in order.

183
00:10:25,620 --> 00:10:28,737
We have to confirm that the Elder
Tree Fiend has truly been defeated.

184
00:10:28,820 --> 00:10:32,497
If it hasn't, the people who turned into
trees will burn to death in the Inferno.

185
00:10:32,580 --> 00:10:33,698
We can't have that.

186
00:10:34,260 --> 00:10:37,084
Either uproot or cut down
the surrounding trees.

187
00:10:37,240 --> 00:10:39,769
Kikuyu, go and dispose
of every last plank.

188
00:10:39,940 --> 00:10:42,277
Shui, keep an eye on our
surroundings just in case.

189
00:10:42,360 --> 00:10:44,617
Let's slow that fire
down as much as we can.

190
00:10:44,700 --> 00:10:45,530
Yes, sir!

191
00:10:46,140 --> 00:10:49,493
But will that be enough to
hold back a fire that intense?

192
00:11:09,980 --> 00:11:12,156
I guess it's the only way to survive.

193
00:11:13,120 --> 00:11:15,200
Boxxo, I need a favor. Huh?

194
00:11:15,440 --> 00:11:17,660
Hulemy, do you have some secret plan?

195
00:11:17,980 --> 00:11:21,717
Boxxo, can't you change into something
that dispenses highly flammable oil?

196
00:11:21,800 --> 00:11:22,630
Hello there.

197
00:11:22,760 --> 00:11:23,590
Change into that,

198
00:11:23,673 --> 00:11:26,437
and then I want you to spread oil
from here right to the other side.

199
00:11:26,520 --> 00:11:27,350
What?

200
00:11:27,433 --> 00:11:29,697
Spread kerosene around when
there's a blaze coming?

201
00:11:29,780 --> 00:11:30,610
No way!

202
00:11:30,920 --> 00:11:33,417
That would be like signing
our own death warrants.

203
00:11:33,500 --> 00:11:35,180
I know what I'm doing here.

204
00:11:35,420 --> 00:11:37,400
Please, Boxxo, just trust me.

205
00:11:37,960 --> 00:11:39,220
She means it.

206
00:11:40,080 --> 00:11:40,920
Hello there.

207
00:11:43,560 --> 00:11:45,560
I so appreciate you, Boxxo.

208
00:11:47,240 --> 00:11:48,800
Good. Just like that.

209
00:11:49,060 --> 00:11:50,237
Ah, now I get it.

210
00:11:50,320 --> 00:11:52,480
Fight fire with fire. Voxo?

211
00:11:53,160 --> 00:11:53,990
No.

212
00:11:54,073 --> 00:11:55,137
What are you thinking?

213
00:11:55,220 --> 00:11:56,720
There is a...

214
00:11:59,020 --> 00:12:00,480
Everyone, listen up.

215
00:12:00,800 --> 00:12:04,297
This forest's trees catch fire easily
and then burn up rather quickly.

216
00:12:04,380 --> 00:12:06,204
So if we burn these away first,

217
00:12:06,380 --> 00:12:09,500
we can keep that blaze from
getting any closer to us.

218
00:12:09,720 --> 00:12:11,191
That's an excellent plan.

219
00:12:11,360 --> 00:12:14,300
Sorry, I should have
trusted you. Don't be.

220
00:12:14,440 --> 00:12:15,911
It's still a huge gamble.

221
00:12:24,880 --> 00:12:27,920
This fire's too intense at this rate.

222
00:12:28,240 --> 00:12:30,677
I'll just have to protect
us with my barrier.

223
00:12:30,760 --> 00:12:32,580
But its range is so limited.

224
00:12:34,640 --> 00:12:36,440
To protect this many people.

225
00:12:36,820 --> 00:12:38,820
I don't have time to mull it over.

226
00:12:41,440 --> 00:12:42,270
Boxo?

227
00:12:42,353 --> 00:12:43,957
You're getting massive, so move.

228
00:12:44,040 --> 00:12:46,560
You mean move away from you? Hello there.

229
00:12:47,500 --> 00:12:48,540
Form change!

230
00:12:49,060 --> 00:12:50,820
Oh, close.

231
00:12:51,580 --> 00:12:52,640
Activate barrier!

232
00:13:10,320 --> 00:13:11,497
That's some serious heat.

233
00:13:11,580 --> 00:13:13,286
I'm losing points like crazy.

234
00:13:28,120 --> 00:13:30,837
Things are still a little hot,
but I think we're okay now.

235
00:13:30,920 --> 00:13:33,420
You saved us there, Boxo. You are what?

236
00:13:34,300 --> 00:13:36,540
Oh, um, point. It's low.

237
00:13:37,740 --> 00:13:38,570
Okay.

238
00:13:38,860 --> 00:13:40,277
Thanks for doing that for us.

239
00:13:40,360 --> 00:13:41,557
I hope you know we're grateful.

240
00:13:41,640 --> 00:13:44,457
If we get back safely, I'll
repay you with lots of coins.

241
00:13:44,540 --> 00:13:45,597
Yeah, sorry, Boxo.

242
00:13:45,680 --> 00:13:49,257
When we get home, I'll smash my
piggy bank and help out, too.

243
00:13:49,340 --> 00:13:51,399
The thought alone more than counts.

244
00:13:51,780 --> 00:13:52,700
Thanks, Boxer.

245
00:13:52,880 --> 00:13:57,468
I only have one gold coin on me right
now, but hopefully that will help a bit.

246
00:13:57,860 --> 00:13:58,690
Hello there.

247
00:13:59,180 --> 00:14:00,240
I'll pay up, too.

248
00:14:00,680 --> 00:14:03,017
Don't worry, I'll thank you
properly when we get back.

249
00:14:03,100 --> 00:14:04,977
I'd never live it down
if you thought the Dark

250
00:14:05,060 --> 00:14:07,825
Forest Stratum was full
of chintzy cheapskates.

251
00:14:08,000 --> 00:14:10,588
I may look like a shadow,
but I ain't shady.

252
00:14:10,860 --> 00:14:13,919
Okay, with that settled, I
can be of a bit more use.

